            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Morgan\"</code> soyadı gibi ikinci bir değeri fonksiyona geçirmek için virgülün ardından değeri yazarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>\"Morgan\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon çağrısına başka bir değer aktarmak için virgül ve ardından bu değeri yaz.</p><p>Kodun <code>Alex Morgan</code> yazdırması için çağrıyı tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>\"Morgan\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
