            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni parametreyi ekleyip eşleşen bir değer geçirdikten sonra, tıpkı burada <code>last</code> ile olduğu gibi onu fonksiyonun içinde kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>+</code>, ardından <code>last</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir parametre ekleyip eşleşen bir değer aktardıktan sonra bunu <code>last</code> örneğindeki gibi fonksiyonda kullanabiliriz.</p><p>İki ad arasında boşluk olacak şekilde <code>Alex Morgan</code> yazdırmak için iki parametreyi de kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;first&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;last&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>first</code>, ardından <code>\" \"</code> ve son olarak <code>last</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
