            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değerlere, tıpkı burada <code>first</code> için <code>\"Alex\"</code> ve <code>last</code> için <code>\"Morgan\"</code> kullanıldığı gibi, fonksiyonun parametrelerinin sırasına göre değer atarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Alex\"</code>, ardından <code>\"Morgan\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değerler parametrelere sırayla yerleşir. Kodun aynı sırayla <code>Alex Morgan</code> yazdırması için iki adı da aktar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexander&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Alex\"</code>, ardından <code>\"Morgan\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
