          {
            "title": "Multiple parameters",
            "id": 86513,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İstediğimiz kadar parametre ekleyebiliriz; yeter ki onları virgüllerle ayıralım, burada <code>third</code> ile yaptığımız gibi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;First place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Second place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Third place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First place: Kim\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second place: Lee\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third place: Ava\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>third</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İhtiyacın olduğu kadar parametre ekleyebilir ve onları virgülle ayırabilirsin.</p><p>Son satırın <code>Third place: Ava</code> yazdırması için üçüncü bir parametre ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;First place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Second place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Third place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"second\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First place: Kim\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second place: Lee\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third place: Ava\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>third</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
