            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsolda en son hangi değer görüntülenir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1st: Helen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Joe</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Helen</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Joe</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Joe</code> neden çıktının ikinci satırında görünür?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1st: Helen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İkinci argüman, ikinci <code>print()</code> çağrısının kullandığı <code>second</code> değerine dönüşür.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python fonksiyon argümanlarını alfabetik sırada yazdırır.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İkinci argüman <code>first</code> değerinin yerini alır.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İkinci argüman, ikinci <code>print()</code> çağrısının kullandığı <code>second</code> değerine dönüşür.</p></body></html>"
